Package: VetBLCM
Title: Local Bayesian Latent Class Diagnostic Evaluation
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(person("Zihan", "Tian", role = "aut"), person("Aizhen", "Guo", role = "aut"), person("Yingyu", "Chen", role = "aut"))
